    "body": "> then the timing of the \"dispose\" event is linked to the other document, and that timing will be incorrect when observed by the parent window.\r\n\r\nWhat do you mean by incorrect?\r\n\r\nPerhaps relevant: since all such documents are in the same agent, they share the same event loop. And all tasks use the same \"navigation and traversal task source\". I'm not sure that's enough to tackle what you're thinking of, but worth keeping in mind...",
